{"v":1,"dreams":[{"id":"demo15","title":"Harry plopper","date":"2026-06-30T07:15:00.000Z","text":"Harry showed me a diagram of the sun and moon along a spine in an endless pool. Ebb and the one I love were there.","summary":"Harry reveals a sun and moon spine diagram.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo14","title":"Hag at the window","date":"2026-06-29T07:14:00.000Z","text":"A hag looked through the window pane of the old school. Ebb was beside me. I knew she was mine.","summary":"A hag watches through a window pane.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo13","title":"Tall locker","date":"2026-06-29T07:13:00.000Z","text":"At the old school a locker reached the ceiling. Henry stood guard. I measured my power level against it.","summary":"A towering school locker and a test of power.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo12","title":"Trauma Tyler","date":"2026-06-28T07:12:00.000Z","text":"Tyler the creator led me through a manor that was a labyrinth. He wore a mask. I painted my way out.","summary":"Tyler leads the dreamer through a labyrinth manor.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo11","title":"Hooves","date":"2026-06-28T07:11:00.000Z","text":"Jesse had hooves and carried a staff. A warrior asked me what I was seeking.","summary":"Jesse appears with hooves and a staff.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo10","title":"BPD yarn","date":"2026-06-27T07:10:00.000Z","text":"I untangled yarn with Tayleur in the garden. Old social patterns kept knotting it. A wound on my hand would not close.","summary":"Untangling yarn keeps snagging on old patterns.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo9","title":"Final five year plan","date":"2026-06-26T07:19:00.000Z","text":"I drew a roadmap for five years with a builder. It felt like service and mastery, and my mother approved.","summary":"A five year roadmap is drawn with a builder.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo8","title":"Falling dragon","date":"2026-06-26T07:18:00.000Z","text":"A dragon fell from a beanstalk past politicians and a false king. I was given weapons and blessings.","summary":"A dragon falls from a beanstalk past a false king.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo7","title":"Parasite creature with mouths","date":"2026-06-25T07:17:00.000Z","text":"A creature covered in mouths clung to my back. Ethan tried to pull it off. I could not stand.","summary":"A many-mouthed parasite clings to the dreamer.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo6","title":"Cleaning the kitchen","date":"2026-06-25T07:16:00.000Z","text":"I scrubbed the kitchen and found rot hidden under the bench. The more I cleaned the more there was.","summary":"Cleaning a kitchen keeps uncovering hidden rot.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo5","title":"Dragons and the fountain of youth","date":"2026-06-21T07:15:00.000Z","text":"Dragons circled a fountain in the underworld. An elder showed me the path up. I felt a creative flow returning.","summary":"Dragons guard a fountain while an elder points the way up.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo4","title":"Chimera","date":"2026-04-06T07:14:00.000Z","text":"At Zoe mother's house a chimera paced behind the fence. Jackson, Billy, Jacob and Alana were there with the dog. I felt trapped.","summary":"A chimera paces behind a fence at a family gathering.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo3","title":"LSD worm","date":"2026-04-05T07:13:00.000Z","text":"In the old house a worm became a butterfly on the kitchen table. Tayleur laughed. Everything was too bright.","summary":"A worm turns into a butterfly inside the old house.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo2","title":"Royal jeweller","date":"2026-04-05T07:12:00.000Z","text":"A jeweller in royal clothing stood trial before a judge. Katie Rose and Lizette were in the gallery. A bird with a hood sat on his staff.","summary":"A royal jeweller is tried while familiar faces watch.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo1","title":"Worm allegory","date":"2026-04-03T07:11:00.000Z","text":"A worm spoke to me beside a fire. It said it was the part of me I kept underground. My mother watched from the garden.","summary":"A worm by a fire claims to be the buried part of the dreamer.","by":"ai"},{"id":"demo0","title":"Refinery worms","date":"2026-04-03T07:10:00.000Z","text":"I was back at the refinery on night shift. The pipes were full of pale worms and I could not walk properly. A booklet explained the plant but the pages kept changing.","summary":"Worms fill the refinery pipes while the dreamer struggles to walk.","by":"ai"}],"nodes":[{"id":"n1p6d1m6629","key":"vocation","name":"Vocation","type":"theme"},{"id":"n536h1w5k42","key":"worm","name":"Worm","type":"symbol"},{"id":"n4q6v2t3h3n","key":"unable to walk","name":"Unable to Walk","type":"symbol"},{"id":"n3u0x2n0y16","key":"will","name":"Will","type":"theme"},{"id":"n665a2o0e31","key":"refinery booklet","name":"Refinery Booklet","type":"symbol"},{"id":"n0018661970","key":"shadow","name":"The Shadow","type":"archetype"},{"id":"n4w0z39576s","key":"shadow integration","name":"Shadow Integration","type":"theme"},{"id":"n5t3440654f","key":"ethan","name":"Ethan","type":"character"},{"id":"n2s2g251a3e","key":"mirror","name":"Mirror","type":"symbol"},{"id":"n2c0a0m7058","key":"fire","name":"Fire","type":"symbol"},{"id":"n3d3z4h0p5e","key":"inner authority","name":"Inner Authority","type":"theme"},{"id":"n4g6h0d6p6n","key":"mother","name":"The Mother","type":"archetype"},{"id":"n6o723y713r","key":"renewal","name":"Renewal","type":"theme"},{"id":"n6m1o4c4i5i","key":"wounded child","name":"The Wounded Child","type":"archetype"},{"id":"n4s4j6g1v5v","key":"garden","name":"Garden","type":"place"},{"id":"n206t3k1i6o","key":"family system","name":"Family System","type":"theme"},{"id":"n2z290w4t4q","key":"escape","name":"Escape","type":"theme"},{"id":"n081x384n4y","key":"weapon","name":"Weapon","type":"symbol"},{"id":"n113y654r5z","key":"jeweller","name":"Jeweller","type":"symbol"},{"id":"n592i4d433r","key":"judge","name":"The Judge","type":"archetype"},{"id":"n5y5a2e635g","key":"trial","name":"Trial","type":"symbol"},{"id":"n144c5w3a6e","key":"guilt","name":"Guilt","type":"theme"},{"id":"n1m5p545k3s","key":"artist","name":"The Artist","type":"arc